"name": "CONMED Corporation",
"description": "CONMED Corp. is a medical technology company, which engages in providing devices and equipment for surgical procedures. Its products include AirSeal and insufflation, allograft cartilage and tissue, arthroplasty, biliary and endoscopic ultrasound, biomedical sensors and electrodes, biopsy and polypectomy, dilators and accessories, electrosurgical units, fixation devices, hemostasis, implants and suture anchors, infection prevention, patient positioning, and related products. The company was founded by Eugene R. Corasanti in 1970 and is headquartered in Largo, FL.",
